From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lalit Maganti <lalitmaganti@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 1 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: nopr: extract FlamegraphFilterBar + hideFilterBar + export
 computeFlamegraphTree

Expose the flamegraph's machinery so an embedder can build a shared UI around it:
- Split the filter / display bar into a standalone exported FlamegraphFilterBar,
  with hideFilterBar to suppress the widget's built-in copy and
  showViewControls / showDisplayOptions to tailor which controls a shared bar
  shows for non-flamegraph views.
- Export computeFlamegraphTree so a call tree or a flat functions list can run on
  the exact same filtering / pivoting pipeline (and metric) as the flamegraph.
- Move the .filter-bar styles to the top level so the bar renders correctly when
  detached from .pf-flamegraph.
Sismo-local; no upstream PR yet.
